{"title": "Lolth's Candle", "pageid": 5903, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Lolth's_Candle", "categories": ["Alchemical ingredients", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Lolth%27s_Candle_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Lolth%27s_Candle_Icon.png/300px-Lolth%27s_Candle_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/0/08/Lolth%27s_Candle_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Lolth's Candle image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Lolth%27s_Candle_Icon.png/300px-Lolth%27s_Candle_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Lolth%27s_Candle_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Lolth's Candle</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Alchemy\" title=\"Alchemy\">Alchemy Ingredient</a>. Combine 3 of these to create <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Vitriol_of_Lolth%27s_Candle\" title=\"Vitriol of Lolth's Candle\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Vitriol_of_Lolth%27s_Candle_Item_Icon.png/20px-Vitriol_of_Lolth%27s_Candle_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e7/Vitriol_of_Lolth%27s_Candle_Item_Icon.png/30px-Vitriol_of_Lolth%27s_Candle_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e7/Vitriol_of_Lolth%27s_Candle_Item_Icon.png/40px-Vitriol_of_Lolth%27s_Candle_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Vitriol_of_Lolth%27s_Candle_Item_Icon.png/20px-Vitriol_of_Lolth%27s_Candle_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Vitriol_of_Lolth%27s_Candle_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Vitriol_of_Lolth%27s_Candle\" title=\"Vitriol of Lolth's Candle\">Vitriol of Lolth's Candle</a>, which is used to make <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Malice\" title=\"Malice\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/93/COAT_Malice_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-COAT_Malice_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/93/COAT_Malice_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-COAT_Malice_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/93/COAT_Malice_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-COAT_Malice_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/93/COAT_Malice_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-COAT_Malice_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/93/COAT_Malice_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Malice\" title=\"Malice\">Malice</a>.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>Glowing stones that flicker in the darkness. Some travellers find themselves following <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Lolth%27s_candle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"these lights\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Lolth%27s_candle\">these lights</a></span>, thinking they might have found a friendly fellow wanderer.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Alchemical_Ingredients\" title=\"Alchemical Ingredients\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7c/Alchemy_Icon.png/25px-Alchemy_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7c/Alchemy_Icon.png/38px-Alchemy_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7c/Alchemy_Icon.png/50px-Alchemy_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Alchemical Ingredients\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7c/Alchemy_Icon.png/25px-Alchemy_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7c/Alchemy_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Alchemical_Ingredients\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Alchemical Ingredients\">Alchemical Ingredients</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Common\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: Common</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.05 kg (0.1 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.05 kg (0.1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 25 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  25  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-e03b3605aebb3bf3END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-c4fd9d3aa6e710feEND_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">LOOT_Alchemy_Crystal_LolthsCandle_A</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:LOOT_Alchemy_Crystal_LolthsCandle_A\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:LOOT_Alchemy_Crystal_LolthsCandle_A\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">6f023cc2-467c-4931-90af-ba0c3f751eee</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:6f023cc2-467c-4931-90af-ba0c3f751eee\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:6f023cc2-467c-4931-90af-ba0c3f751eee\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Several can be found in the <a href=\"/wiki/Bibberbang\" title=\"Bibberbang\">Bibberbang</a> field west of the <a href=\"/wiki/Myconid_Colony\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Myconid Colony\">Myconid Colony</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Underdark\" title=\"Underdark\">Underdark</a></li>\n<li>One can be found in the <a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Tower\" title=\"Arcane Tower\">Arcane Tower</a> on the table by the garden entrance to the tower</li>\n<li>One can be found on the corpse of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Xargrim\" title=\"Xargrim\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Portrait_Xargrim.png/25px-Portrait_Xargrim.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Portrait_Xargrim.png/38px-Portrait_Xargrim.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Portrait_Xargrim.png/50px-Portrait_Xargrim.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Xargrim\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Portrait_Xargrim.png/25px-Portrait_Xargrim.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a0/Portrait_Xargrim.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Xargrim\" title=\"Xargrim\">Xargrim</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;55&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-90</span></li></ul>\n</div>   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Named after <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lolth\" title=\"Lolth\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/01/Lolth_Icon.webp/15px-Lolth_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/01/Lolth_Icon.webp/23px-Lolth_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/01/Lolth_Icon.webp/31px-Lolth_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lolth\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/01/Lolth_Icon.webp/15px-Lolth_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"15\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/01/Lolth_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lolth\" title=\"Lolth\">Lolth</a>, Goddess of the <a href=\"/wiki/Drow\" title=\"Drow\">Drow</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202104\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.073 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.078 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2638/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 35131/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 10699/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 28/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.025/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1037666/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   63.018      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   63.018      1 -total\n 46.39%   29.237      1 Template:PageSeo\n 46.22%   29.128      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 36.59%   23.059      2 Template:SmRarityItem\n 33.03%   20.814      8 Template:Icon_text\n 32.28%   20.344     30 Template:Trim\n 23.87%   15.045      2 Template:Item_icon\n 15.01%    9.458      2 Template:Uid\n 10.23%    6.449      4 Template:Icon_link\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:5903-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202104 and revision id 366294. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}